===============================================================================

PocketLedger is a privacy-first consumer finance application. The AGPL-3.0
license is deliberate: any fork that runs as a network service must publish
its source. This protects the privacy posture from being silently compromised
by a fork, and discourages direct copying of the closed-source competitor model.

If you fork this codebase and deploy it as a network service, you must publish
your modifications under AGPL-3.0. Contact licensing@pocketledger.app for
commercial licensing terms.

